        "steam_appid": 3210120,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/cabe9e6669a68363d061318c9c986d7a.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>With Christmas Spirit running low, things aren’t so merry at the North Pole. Santa’s sleigh won’t fly, gifts aren’t ready, and there’s a chance that some children won’t end up on Santa’s Nice List. But that’s about to change now that you are stepping in to help Santa on this festive mission. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/456f287ad3156713469ee84eb27d5565.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/3b4015f71e1e57e55a12c9adef0d404c.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>First stop… Scout Elf School. Dash, swing, and leap through magical challenges to become an “official Scout Elf”! It’ll get tricky sometimes, but it’ll mostly be fun and rewarding! In true The Elf on the Shelf tradition, you’ll meet your new family and receive your Scout Elf name. You’ll mix, match and dazzle – create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/4836ea30ce6fb72a94e7f5fb37952ce5.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/9a4146d386b7d6c366198a7191aaf6b1.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>As an official Scout Elf, you won’t just perch in your new spot in the home. You’ll spread holiday cheer, explore every room and fly around the kitchen, over the backyard and back to the North Pole while dodging nutcrackers, swinging past Christmas ornaments and escaping all sorts of obstacles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/13b2edf7221b69df337bc9fb4f911421.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/1758675b5a1a46c13a3afb7aaeb51205.avif?t=1760688174\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><br>Create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This season, pledge to make things merry and bright, helping Santa bring joy to children everywhere!<br><br><strong><i>Are you ready to be a Christmas Hero?</i></strong><br><br><br><strong>IMMERSE IN A CHRISTMAS TRADITION:</strong> Follow the story or enjoy fun minigames. There’s something for everyone to bring holiday cheer. <br><br><strong>BECOME A SCOUT ELF: </strong>Complete your training and help Santa figure out who’s on his Nice List. <br><br><strong>PLAY MINIGAMES FILLED WITH MAGIC:</strong> Put your skills to the test by solving puzzles, matching cards, sorting ornaments and making your way through mazes. <br><br><strong>COLLECT TO SPARKLE &amp; SHINE:</strong> Run, jump, and swing through levels building your Christmas Spirit Counter. If you miss them, you can always go back.  <br><br><strong>DESIGN YOUR ELF HERO:</strong> Create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories.",
