ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.poster.avif?t=1760688174\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.webm?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210120/extras/86ae09bc0a9091c4473f8e7839b6492a.mp4?t=1760688174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This season, pledge to make things merry and bright, helping Santa bring joy to children everywhere!<br><br><strong><i>Are you ready to be a Christmas Hero?</i></strong><br><br><br><strong>IMMERSE IN A CHRISTMAS TRADITION:</strong> Follow the story or enjoy fun minigames. There’s something for everyone to bring holiday cheer. <br><br><strong>BECOME A SCOUT ELF: </strong>Complete your training and help Santa figure out who’s on his Nice List. <br><br><strong>PLAY MINIGAMES FILLED WITH MAGIC:</strong> Put your skills to the test by solving puzzles, matching cards, sorting ornaments and making your way through mazes. <br><br><strong>COLLECT TO SPARKLE &amp; SHINE:</strong> Run, jump, and swing through levels building your Christmas Spirit Counter. If you miss them, you can always go back.  <br><br><strong>DESIGN YOUR ELF HERO:</strong> Create the perfect holiday outfit with sparkling seasonal accessories.",
